  "id": "04",
  "title": "AOT Routing Engine",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.12) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFB800\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon's <strong>AOT Routing Engine</strong> is built for scale. By combining a predictive Radix Tree with compile-time hashing, it ensures that your requests reach their destination in the fewest possible CPU cycles.</p></div><h2>The Intelligence Layer</h2><p>Routing isn't just about matching strings. It's about optimizing the lookup path. Photon analyzes your route topology at startup to select the most efficient dispatching strategy.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">RADIX_PRECISION</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Optimized Radix Tree for dynamic segments. Captures <code>:id</code> or <code>*wildcard</code> parameters with near-zero allocation cost.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L22 2\"/><path d=\"M15 5.89L18.11 9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">AOT_HASHING</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Static routes are pre-hashed into a lookup table. For high-frequency endpoints, lookup is O(1).</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">RESOURCE_FULL</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Declarative RESTful routing. One line generates a full suite of optimized endpoints (Index, Store, Show, etc.).</p></div></div><h2>Expressive Dispatching</h2><p>Photon provides a fluent API that feels natural to write while maintaining extreme execution speed.</p><pre><code>// Static Dispatch\napp.get('/health', (c) => c.text('OK'))\n\n// Dynamic Parameter Extraction\napp.get('/users/:id', (c) => {\n  const id = c.req.param('id')\n  return c.json({ id })\n})\n\n// Grouped Logic with Middleware\napp.prefix('/api/v1').middleware(auth).group((routes) => {\n  routes.resource('orders', OrderController)\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// ROUTE_SPEC: PREDICTIVE_WARMUP</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">During the application warmup, Photon generates a <strong>Route Metadata Matrix</strong>. This allows the dispatcher to jump directly to the handler without iterative overhead, even in complex nested groups.</p></div><h2>Performance Benchmarks</h2><p>Throughput comparison across different routing complexities (100+ Static vs 20 Dynamic Routes).</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_AOT_DISPATCH</span> <span>~120k req/s (Dynamic)</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,184,0,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: #FFB800; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,184,0,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>TRADITIONAL_REGEX_ROUTER</span> <span>~45k req/s</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 35%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// METRIC: AOT CROSS-MATCHING IS 2.5X FASTER THAN REGEX-BASED ENGINES</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Architect's Insight:</strong> Most routers slow down as the number of routes grows. Photon's Radix-Hashing hybrid scales logarithmically, ensuring that your 1,000th route is just as fast as your 1st.</p></div>",
